{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \widctlpar \f4\fs20 {\f5\cf4 Commander:
\par 
\par Our situation is desperate.  We simply do not have enough expertise in the sciences for building our starship.
\par 
\par Any effort we can make to acquire further knowledge in the field is warranted.  A second }{\i\f5\cf4 Conestoga}{\f5\cf4  wreckage site, located in the Tsiolkovsky Hills, may yield data we need.
\par 
\par If necessary, scan all the wreckage sites with a Scout and then load any valuable pieces in Cargo Trucks.  
\par 
\par Beware of Eden units in the area.  Do not let them salvage any parts of the wreckage.  If they do, use the EMP and Spider combination to capture the Truck carrying the wreckage before Eden can retreat with it.
\par 
\par Return all of the needed parts to the convoy\rquote s starting location.
\par 
\par The Specific Objectives list may have other useful information.
\par 
\par }}